        },
        {
          "text": "“Kare ame Parao abaka me Miciri bino nenogi, cunye bino kwe pi to mere, kede pi to a lwakkere ame oneko aneka i pala lweny. Man kop ame Rwot Obaŋa okobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pien i kare me kwo mere, en obedo miyo jo ame kwo lworo, mannono omio obino pyele i akina jo ame mom ŋeo Obaŋa, karacel i lwak ame oneko aneka i pala lweny. Parao karacel i lwakkere luŋ.” Man kop ame Rwot Obaŋa okobo.",
          "type": "text",
